This product includes software derived from iqpopt
(https://github.com/XanaduAI/iqpopt), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

- The files under iqp_fast/ that come from iqpopt were modified. The package
  was renamed to iqp_fast and, among other changes, the following were added: float32 defaults,
  grouped and pairwise expectation paths, branch/label conditioning of the
  estimator and the MMD loss, and a sparse-op GPU kernel path. Each such file
  states its changes in its header.
- randomized_iqp/trainer.py contains MMD loss estimators adapted from iqpopt
  and modified. Its header says so.

